        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700 lg:text-lg lg:leading-8">
          All content published on <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Nintendo News Hub</strong>, including articles, tags, analyses, and social metrics, is for informational purposes only. While we strive for accuracy, we do not guarantee the completeness or reliability of any content. You acknowledge that any reliance on our content is at your own risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">2. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700 lg:text-lg lg:leading-8">
          All original content created and published on this site is the property of <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Nintendo News Hub</strong>, unless otherwise noted. You may share, link, or quote from our articles with proper attribution, but you may not reproduce or republish content in full without explicit written permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-10">
