          You agree not to use the site for any unlawful purpose or to violate any laws in your jurisdiction. You also agree not to attempt to interfere with the site's functionality, security, or performance through hacking, scraping, or other unauthorized activities.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">4. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700 lg:text-lg lg:leading-8">
          <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Nintendo News Hub</strong> may include links to third-party websites, including original news sources and social platforms. We are not responsible for the content, availability, or practices of these external sites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">5. Analytics & Tracking</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700 lg:text-lg lg:leading-8">
          We use tools to analyze traffic, user behavior, and social engagement in order to improve our services and editorial decisions. By using this site, you consent to our use of cookies and analytical tracking methods as outlined in our 
          <%= link_to "Privacy Policy", privacy_path, class: "font-medium text-indigo-600 transition-colors hover:text-indigo-500" %>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">6. Modifications to the Service</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700 lg:text-lg lg:leading-8">
