        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700 lg:text-lg lg:leading-8">
          We may update these Terms of Service from time to time. Continued use of the site after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the updated terms. Please check this page periodically for updates.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-10 border-t border-slate-200 pt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">9. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-700 lg:text-lg lg:leading-8">
